{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790908800, "covers_from": "2026-10-02T02:40:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-02T02:41:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790908860, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-02T02:40:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 11041, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "加快都更進度", "display_name": "大同代表 No.11,041", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-02T02:40:05+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 9618, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "我就附近公車站的垃圾桶和座椅都被拆掉了，不知道為什麼，希望可以裝回來", "display_name": "松山代表 No.9,618", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-02T02:40:16+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 39605, "sprite_key": "bear_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "勞工", "content": "洪申翰一直保護外勞，外勞想換雇主就換。而且外勞可以不斷擺臉色給雇主，雇主更換外勞卻有空窗期🤬🤬", "display_name": "中山代表 No.39,605", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-02T02:40:31+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 38265, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "成功橋下雨就是塞車，下班從潭美公園到昆陽捷運站，一堆人等上車，至少要等30分鐘以上，結果公車全塞在橋", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.38,265", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-02T02:40:46+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 8724, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "請把移除的垃圾桶放回去，有個笨蛋沒辦法處理鼠患，就拿垃圾桶開刀，造成市民不便也不滿", "display_name": "中山代表 鍾豑", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 9618, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.9,618", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 39605, "sprite_key": "bear_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 No.39,605", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay